<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>GENÈVE — 하늘을 걷다</title><link rel="icon" href="data:,">
<script>window.CESIUM_BASE_URL='./vendor/cesium/Build/Cesium/';</script>
<script src="./vendor/cesium/Build/Cesium/Cesium.js"></script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="./vendor/cesium/Build/Cesium/Widgets/widgets.css">
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body,#world{margin:0;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#111b20}body{font-family:'Helvetica Neue','Apple SD Gothic Neo',Arial,sans-serif;color:#fff9ee}.cesium-viewer-bottom{display:none!important}.cesium-widget-credits{display:none!important}
#vignette{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 42%,transparent 40%,#0a182525 100%),linear-gradient(0deg,#101b2670,transparent 28%,transparent 80%,#101b2630)}
.bar{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;background:#0c171d;z-index:2}.top{top:0;height:70px}.bottom{bottom:0;height:70px}.wordmark{position:absolute;left:64px;top:24px;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:7px;font-weight:500}.edition{position:absolute;right:64px;top:28px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#b7c9c9}.line{display:inline-block;width:28px;height:1px;background:#c8ac7d;vertical-align:middle;margin:0 18px}
#chapter{position:absolute;left:76px;bottom:136px;text-shadow:0 2px 16px #10212d90}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#f0d4a4;margin-bottom:18px}#name{font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:57px;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:-1.4px;line-height:1.05}#korean{font-size:21px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:2px;margin-top:16px}#subtitle{font-size:13px;color:#d4e1e0;letter-spacing:1px;margin-top:12px}
#intro{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-direction:column;pointer-events:none;text-shadow:0 3px 20px #0b293b90}#intro h1{font:normal 128px Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:22px;margin:0 0 20px 22px}#intro p{font-size:25px;letter-spacing:10px;margin:0}#intro small{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:6px;margin-bottom:34px;color:#f0d4a4}
#route{position:absolute;left:64px;bottom:25px;display:flex;gap:27px;align-items:center;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px}.stop{color:#7e999f;white-space:nowrap}.stop:before{content:'';display:inline-block;width:4px;height:4px;border:1px solid #7e999f;border-radius:50%;margin-right:9px;vertical-align:2px}.stop.active{color:#f0d4a4}.stop.active:before{background:#f0d4a4;border-color:#f0d4a4}.stop.done{color:#d0dcda}
#credit{position:absolute;right:64px;bottom:26px;font-size:11px;color:#b4c4c7;letter-spacing:.3px}.progress{position:absolute;bottom:69px;height:2px;background:#d6b984;left:0;transform-origin:left center}#pin{position:absolute;width:12px;height:12px;border:1px solid #fff8d0;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 0 6px #fff8d025;pointer-events:none;display:none}#coordinates{position:absolute;right:64px;top:99px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:right;line-height:2;color:#ffffffb0}#fade{position:absolute;inset:0;background:#0c171d;pointer-events:none;z-index:5;opacity:0}
#play{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:10;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#10202c50;cursor:pointer}.button{padding:22px 38px;background:#11232ee0;border:1px solid #c5b58a;border-radius:2px;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:2px}
</style></head><body>
<div id="world"></div><div id="vignette"></div>
<div id="chapter"><div class="eyebrow" id="number"></div><div id="name"></div><div id="korean"></div><div id="subtitle"></div></div>
<div id="intro"><small>SWITZERLAND · AN AERIAL JOURNEY</small><h1>GENÈVE</h1><p>제네바, 하늘을 걷다</p></div>
<div id="coordinates"></div><div id="pin"></div>
<div class="bar top"><div class="wordmark">GENÈVE<span class="line"></span><span style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#c9d8d7">하늘을 걷다</span></div><div class="edition">A 3D AERIAL FILM <span class="line"></span> 46°12′ N / 6°09′ E</div></div>
<div class="bar bottom"><div id="route"></div><div id="credit">© swisstopo · 실제 지형 기반 3D 시뮬레이션</div></div><div class="progress" id="progress"></div><div id="fade"></div>
<div id="play"><div class="button">▶ 비행 시작</div></div>
<script type="module" src="./src/flight.js"></script>
</body></html>
